# Desktop-testing copy of the library for the CircuitPython examples
examples/circuitpython/www/
examples/circuitpython/.venv-desktop/

# Output of `python3 mcp_agent.py`. The README lists these under "Output
# Files", and its directory listing shows only the script and the README --
# a committed copy contradicts that. build_page inlines dist/bitwrench.umd.min.js,
# so any checked-in copy pins one build and is stale after the next rebuild.
examples/mcp-agent/dashboard.html
examples/mcp-agent/dashboard.png
# ...and the same outputs at the repo root, because the README's second
# invocation (`python3 examples/mcp-agent/mcp_agent.py`) runs from there and
# the script writes to os.getcwd().
/dashboard.html
/dashboard.png
